// Ch4 C4-03 "The wake feast", the way in (docs/kb/story/beats/act1_ch04.md). The causeway head (H12):
// trestle tables along the wake-shell wall, a hundred oil lamps on its top and in the saltgrass, the
// tide in and the causeway a dark line out to the islet, the game's first full sea-glow beyond the
// lamps (color script ch04, lut_ch04_wake: Rendering's). Villagers sing work songs and star-paths; the
// Order hums, and nobody here is humming. Played once, on the way into the lamplight.
// Ysolde is seen once, at the edge of the lamplight beyond the last table: tall, indigo-black, very
// straight, alone, not eating. A 1.5 s hold on H12; nobody points her out, and no line names her.
// Then the walkable feast: Asha moves table to table (ch04_wake_vendor, _osu, _fisher, _neme).
// Music: haluna_wake (diegetic).
title: ch04_the_wake
location: ch04/haluna_wake
---
@music haluna_wake fade=3.0
@camera H12 blend=1.5
Asha [smile]: Come and eat, Rhen. Neme cooked for a village, and the village cooked for three. #line:ch04_wake_001
@wait 1.5
@camera release
===
